  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Auto-review 的角色與估價邊界",
      "description": "說明 approval reviewer、model、token 類型與兩種估價的可觀測邊界。",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 自動審核器尚未提供實際模型\n\nCodex 以 `codex-auto-review` 識別自動審核角色，目前沒有提供實際模型名稱。圖表以「未提供實際模型」顯示這類資料；仍可統計 Review 次數、Token 與 cached input 比例。缺少模型或適用費率時，公開 API 費用與 Codex Credits 顯示「未估價」，不代表零成本。Cached input 通常依適用公開費率折價，**不是免費**。此儀表板統計本機操作核准的自動審核，不等同 GitHub PR Code Review。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Reviewer Telemetry 距今",
      "description": "最後一筆 approval-reviewer total-token telemetry 距離現在多久；用來辨識 exporter 或 Collector 是否停止更新。",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 300
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 900
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - max(timestamp(ai_agent_turn_token_usage_sum{ai_agent_provider=\"openai\",ai_agent_product=\"codex\",agent_role=\"approval_reviewer\",service_namespace!~\"^ai-collaboration(-cost|-role)?-fixture$\",token_type=\"total\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "距今秒數",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "所選範圍 Review 次數",
      "description": "以 total-token histogram count 估計所選範圍 approval-reviewer turns；四捨五入 range extrapolation 小數。",
